msgstr "/etc/kea/kea-dhcp6.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:293
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/kea/kea-dhcp-ddns.conf"
msgstr "/etc/kea/kea-dhcp-ddns.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:298
#, xml-text
msgid "Kea Control Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Controle do Kea"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:300
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>keactrl</command> is used to control the independent servers (IPv4,"
" IPv6, DDNS). Its configuration file, "
"<filename>/etc/kea/keactrl.conf</filename>, is installed by default and "
"includes many path settings which are defined from the "
"<command>configure</command> at build time. It also includes settings to "
"specify which of the servers should be started."
msgstr ""
"<command>keactrl</command> é usado para controlar os servidores "
"independentes (IPv4, IPv6, DDNS). O arquivo de configuração dele, "
"<filename>/etc/kea/keactrl.conf</filename>, é instalado por padrão e inclui "
"muitas configurações de caminho que são definidas a partir do "
"<command>configure</command> ao tempo da construção. Também inclui "
"configurações para especificar quais dos servidores deveriam ser iniciados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:310 blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:375
#, xml-text
msgid "Control Agent"
msgstr "Agente de Controle"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:311
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The Control Agent is a daemon which allows the (re)configuration of the Kea "
"DHCP service via REST API.  Set <literal>ctrl_agent=yes</literal> to start "
"the control agent (service providing a REST API), set "
"<literal>ctrl_agent=no</literal> in case the control agent is not needed."
msgstr ""
"O Agente de Controle é um processo de segundo plano que permite a "
"(re)configuração do serviço DHCP do Kea via API REST. Configure "
"<literal>ctrl_agent=yes</literal> para iniciar o agente de controle (serviço"
" que fornece uma API REST); configure <literal>ctrl_agent=no</literal> caso "
"o agente de controle não seja necessário."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:319 blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:384
#, xml-text
msgid "IPv4 DHCP server"
msgstr "Servidor DHCP de IPv4"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This daemon handles requests for IPv4 addresses.  Set "
"<literal>dhcp4=yes</literal> to start it, set <literal>dhcp4=no</literal> in"
" case the IPv4 service is not needed."
msgstr ""
"Esse processo de segundo plano lida com solicitações de endereços IPv4. "
"Configure <literal>dhcp4=yes</literal> para iniciá-lo; configure "
"<literal>dhcp4=no</literal> caso o serviço de IPv4 não seja necessário."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:326 blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:392
#, xml-text
msgid "IPv6 DHCP server"
msgstr "Servidor DHCP de IPv6"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:327
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This daemon handles requests for IPv6 addresses.  Set "
"<literal>dhcp6=yes</literal> to start it, set <literal>dhcp6=no</literal> in"
" case the IPv6 service is not needed."
msgstr ""
"Esse processo de segundo plano lida com solicitações de endereços IPv6. "
"Configure <literal>dhcp6=yes</literal> para iniciá-lo; configure "
"<literal>dhcp6=no</literal> caso o serviço de IPv6 não seja necessário."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:333 blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:400
#, xml-text
msgid "Dynamic DNS"
msgstr "DNS Dinâmico"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:334
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This daemon is used to update a DNS server dynamically when Kea assigns an "
"IP address to a device.  Set <literal>dhcp_ddns=yes</literal> to enable it, "
"set <literal>dhcp_ddns=no</literal> if dynamic DNS updates are not needed."
msgstr ""
"Esse processo de segundo plano é usado para atualizar dinamicamente um "
"servidor DNS quando Kea atribuir um endereço IP para um dispositivo. "
"Configure <literal>dhcp_ddns=yes</literal> para habilitá-lo; configure "
"<literal>dhcp_ddns=no</literal> se as atualizações dinâmicas de DNS não "
"forem necessárias."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:343 blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:411
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The Netconf service is not installed because the required dependencies are "
"not installed by BLFS, and configuring it correctly is complicated."
msgstr ""
"O serviço Netconf não é instalado porque as dependências exigidas não são "
"instaladas pelo BLFS, e configurá-lo corretamente é complicado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:348
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"With the following command, Kea will be configured to start the DHCP service"
" for IPv4 and the dynamic DNS update, while the control agent and the DHCP "
"service for IPv6 remain down. Tweak the command to match your needs on "
"started services and execute as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Com o seguinte comando, o Kea será configurado para iniciar o serviço DHCP "
"para IPv4 e a atualização dinâmica do DNS, enquanto o agente de controle e o"
" serviço DHCP para IPv6 permanecerão inativos. Ajuste o comando para atender"
" às tuas necessidades nos serviços iniciados e execute como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:356
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/^dhcp4=.*/dhcp4=yes/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/^dhcp6=.*/dhcp6=no/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/^dhcp_ddns=.*/dhcp_ddns=yes/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/^ctrl_agent=.*/ctrl_agent=no/\" \\\n"
"    -i /etc/kea/keactrl.conf\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -e \"s/^dhcp4=.*/dhcp4=yes/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/^dhcp6=.*/dhcp6=no/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/^dhcp_ddns=.*/dhcp_ddns=yes/\" \\\n"
"    -e \"s/^ctrl_agent=.*/ctrl_agent=no/\" \\\n"
"    -i /etc/kea/keactrl.conf\n"
"</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:366
#, xml-text
msgid "Kea Configuration Using Systemd Units"
msgstr "Configuração do Kea Usando Unidades do Systemd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:369
#, xml-text
msgid "Four service units are used to start various daemons provided by Kea:"
msgstr ""
"Quatro unidades de serviço são usadas para iniciar vários processos de "
"segundo plano fornecidos pelo Kea:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:377
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The Control Agent is a daemon which allows the (re)configuration of the Kea "
"DHCP service via REST API.  Run <command>systemctl enable kea-ctrl-"
"agent</command> if this daemon is needed."
msgstr ""
"O Agente de Controle é um processo de segundo plano que permite "
"(re)configuração do serviço DHCP do Kea via API do REST. Execute "
"<command>systemctl enable kea-ctrl-agent</command> se esse processo de "
"segundo plano for necessário."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:386
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This daemon handles requests for IPv4 addresses.  Run <command>systemctl "
"enable kea-dhcp4-server</command> to have it started by systemd."
msgstr ""
"Esse processo de segundo plano lida com solicitações de endereços IPv4. "
"Execute <command>systemctl enable kea-dhcp4-server</command> para tê-lo "
"iniciado pelo systemd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:394
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This daemon handles requests for IPv6 addresses.  Run <command>systemctl "
"enable kea-dhcp6-server</command> to have it started by systemd."
msgstr ""
"Esse processo de segundo plano lida com solicitações de endereços IPv6. "
"Execute <command>systemctl enable kea-dhcp6-server</command> para tê-lo "
"iniciado pelo systemd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:402
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This daemon is used to update a DNS server dynamically when Kea assigns an "
"IP address to a device.  Run <command>systemctl enable kea-ddns-"
"server</command> to have it started by systemd."
msgstr ""
"Esse processo de segundo plano é usado para atualizar um servidor DNS "
"dinamicamente quando Kea atribui um endereço IP para um dispositivo. Execute"
" <command>systemctl enable kea-ddns-server</command> para tê-lo iniciado "
"pelo systemd."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid "Control Agent Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Agente de Controle"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:421
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The provided configuration could be used without changes. However, in BLFS, "
"objects like sockets are stored in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename> rather than in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/tmp</filename>."
msgstr ""
"A configuração fornecida poderia ser usada sem mudanças. No entanto, no "
"BLFS, objetos como soquetes são armazenados em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/run</filename> em vez de em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/tmp</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:428
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>// Begin /etc/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.conf\n"
"{\n"
"  // This is a basic configuration for the Kea Control Agent.\n"
"  // The RESTful interface will be available at http://127.0.0.1:8000/\n"
"  \"Control-agent\": {\n"
"    \"http-host\": \"127.0.0.1\",\n"
"    \"http-port\": 8000,\n"
"    \"control-sockets\": {\n"
"      \"dhcp4\": {\n"
"        \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"        \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea4-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"dhcp6\": {\n"
"        \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"        \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea6-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"d2\": {\n"
"        \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"        \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea-ddns-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"      }\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"loggers\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"kea-ctrl-agent\",\n"
"        \"output_options\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"output\": \"/var/log/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.log\",\n"
"            \"pattern\": \"%D{%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%q} %-5p %m\\n\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n"
"        \"debuglevel\": 0\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"// End /etc/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>// Begin /etc/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.conf\n"
"{\n"
"  // This is a basic configuration for the Kea Control Agent.\n"
"  // The RESTful interface will be available at http://127.0.0.1:8000/\n"
"  \"Control-agent\": {\n"
"    \"http-host\": \"127.0.0.1\",\n"
"    \"http-port\": 8000,\n"
"    \"control-sockets\": {\n"
"      \"dhcp4\": {\n"
"        \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"        \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea4-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"dhcp6\": {\n"
"        \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"        \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea6-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"d2\": {\n"
"        \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"        \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea-ddns-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"      }\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"loggers\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"kea-ctrl-agent\",\n"
"        \"output_options\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"output\": \"/var/log/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.log\",\n"
"            \"pattern\": \"%D{%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%q} %-5p %m\\n\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n"
"        \"debuglevel\": 0\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"// End /etc/kea/kea-ctrl-agent.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:472
#, xml-text
msgid "IPv4 DHCP Server Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Servidor DHCP de IPv4"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:475
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"A sample configuration file is created in <filename>/etc/kea/kea-"
"dhcp4.conf</filename>.  Adjust the file to suit your needs or overwrite it "
"by running the following command as the &root; user (you'll need to edit "
"this file anyway: at least the <emphasis>interfaces</emphasis> field, the "
"<emphasis>ddns-qualifying-suffix</emphasis> field, and almost all the fields"
" in <emphasis>Subnet4</emphasis>):"
msgstr ""
"Um arquivo de configuração de amostra é criado em <filename>/etc/kea/kea-"
"dhcp4.conf</filename>. Ajuste o arquivo para atender às tuas necessidades ou"
" sobrescreva-o executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root; "
"(você precisará editar esse arquivo de qualquer maneira: pelo menos o campo "
"<emphasis>interfaces</emphasis>, o campo <emphasis>ddns-qualifying-"
"suffix</emphasis> e quase todos os campos em <emphasis>Subnet4</emphasis>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:483
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/kea/kea-dhcp4.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>// Begin /etc/kea/kea-dhcp4.conf\n"
"{\n"
"  \"Dhcp4\": {\n"
"    // Add names of your network interfaces to listen on.\n"
"    \"interfaces-config\": {\n"
"      \"interfaces\": [ \"eth0\", \"eth2\" ]\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"control-socket\": {\n"
"      \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"      \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea4-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"lease-database\": {\n"
"      \"type\": \"memfile\",\n"
"      \"lfc-interval\": 3600,\n"
"      \"name\": \"/var/lib/kea/kea-leases4.csv\"\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"expired-leases-processing\": {\n"
"      \"reclaim-timer-wait-time\": 10,\n"
"      \"flush-reclaimed-timer-wait-time\": 25,\n"
"      \"hold-reclaimed-time\": 3600,\n"
"      \"max-reclaim-leases\": 100,\n"
"      \"max-reclaim-time\": 250,\n"
"      \"unwarned-reclaim-cycles\": 5\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"renew-timer\": 900,\n"
"    \"rebind-timer\": 1800,\n"
"    \"valid-lifetime\": 3600,\n"
"\n"
"    // Enable DDNS - Kea will dynamically update the BIND DNS server\n"
"    \"ddns-send-updates\" : true,\n"
"    \"ddns-qualifying-suffix\": \"your.domain.tld\",\n"
"    \"dhcp-ddns\" : {\n"
"      \"enable-updates\": true\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"subnet4\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"id\": 1001,   // Each subnet requires a unique numeric id\n"
"        \"subnet\": \"192.168.56.0/24\",\n"
"        \"pools\": [ { \"pool\": \"192.168.56.16 - 192.168.56.254\" } ],\n"
"        \"option-data\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"domain-name\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"your.domain.tld\"\n"
"          },\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"domain-name-servers\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"192.168.56.2, 192.168.3.7\"\n"
"          },\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"domain-search\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"your.domain.tld\"\n"
"          },\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"routers\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"192.168.56.2\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    \"loggers\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"kea-dhcp4\",\n"
"        \"output_options\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"output\": \"/var/log/kea/kea-dhcp4.log\",\n"
"            \"pattern\": \"%D{%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%q} %-5p %m\\n\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n"
"        \"debuglevel\": 0\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"// End /etc/kea/kea-dhcp4.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/kea/kea-dhcp4.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>// Begin /etc/kea/kea-dhcp4.conf\n"
"{\n"
"  \"Dhcp4\": {\n"
"    // Add names of your network interfaces to listen on.\n"
"    \"interfaces-config\": {\n"
"      \"interfaces\": [ \"eth0\", \"eth2\" ]\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"control-socket\": {\n"
"      \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"      \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea4-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"lease-database\": {\n"
"      \"type\": \"memfile\",\n"
"      \"lfc-interval\": 3600,\n"
"      \"name\": \"/var/lib/kea/kea-leases4.csv\"\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"expired-leases-processing\": {\n"
"      \"reclaim-timer-wait-time\": 10,\n"
"      \"flush-reclaimed-timer-wait-time\": 25,\n"
"      \"hold-reclaimed-time\": 3600,\n"
"      \"max-reclaim-leases\": 100,\n"
"      \"max-reclaim-time\": 250,\n"
"      \"unwarned-reclaim-cycles\": 5\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"renew-timer\": 900,\n"
"    \"rebind-timer\": 1800,\n"
"    \"valid-lifetime\": 3600,\n"
"\n"
"    // Enable DDNS - Kea will dynamically update the BIND DNS server\n"
"    \"ddns-send-updates\" : true,\n"
"    \"ddns-qualifying-suffix\": \"your.domain.tld\",\n"
"    \"dhcp-ddns\" : {\n"
"      \"enable-updates\": true\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"subnet4\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"id\": 1001,   // Each subnet requires a unique numeric id\n"
"        \"subnet\": \"192.168.56.0/24\",\n"
"        \"pools\": [ { \"pool\": \"192.168.56.16 - 192.168.56.254\" } ],\n"
"        \"option-data\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"domain-name\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"your.domain.tld\"\n"
"          },\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"domain-name-servers\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"192.168.56.2, 192.168.3.7\"\n"
"          },\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"domain-search\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"your.domain.tld\"\n"
"          },\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"name\": \"routers\",\n"
"            \"data\": \"192.168.56.2\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    \"loggers\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"kea-dhcp4\",\n"
"        \"output_options\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"output\": \"/var/log/kea/kea-dhcp4.log\",\n"
"            \"pattern\": \"%D{%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%q} %-5p %m\\n\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n"
"        \"debuglevel\": 0\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"// End /etc/kea/kea-dhcp4.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:570
#, xml-text
msgid "IPv6 DHCP Server Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Servidor DHCP de IPv6"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:573
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The configuration for IPv6 is similar to the configuration of IPv4. The "
"configuration file is <filename>/etc/kea/kea-dhcp6.conf</filename>."
msgstr ""
"A configuração para IPv6 é semelhante à configuração do IPv4. O arquivo de "
"configuração é <filename>/etc/kea/kea-dhcp6.conf</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:581
#, xml-text
msgid "Dynamic DNS Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do DNS Dinâmico"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:584
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If there is a <xref linkend=\"bind\"/> server running, <application>ISC "
"Kea</application> can update the DNS records when it gives an IP address to "
"a client. A sample configuration file is created in <filename>/etc/kea/kea-"
"dhcp-ddns.conf</filename>.  Adjust the file to suit your needs or overwrite "
"it by running the following command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se existir um servidor <xref linkend=\"bind\"/> executando, o "
"<application>Kea do ISC</application> poderá atualizar os registros de DNS "
"quando fornecer um endereço IP para um cliente. Um arquivo de configuração "
"de amostra é criado em <filename>/etc/kea/kea-dhcp-ddns.conf</filename>. "
"Ajuste o arquivo para atender às tuas necessidades ou sobrescreva-o "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:592
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/kea/kea-dhcp-ddns.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>// Begin /etc/kea/kea-dhcp-ddns.conf\n"
"{\n"
"  \"DhcpDdns\": {\n"
"    \"ip-address\": \"127.0.0.1\",\n"
"    \"port\": 53001,\n"
"    \"control-socket\": {\n"
"      \"socket-type\": \"unix\",\n"
"      \"socket-name\": \"/run/kea/kea-ddns-ctrl-socket\"\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"tsig-keys\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\"      : \"rndc-key\",\n"
"        \"algorithm\" : \"hmac-sha256\",\n"
"        \"secret\"    : \"1FU5hD7faYaajQCjSdA54JkTPQxbbPrRnzOKqHcD9cM=\"\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    \"forward-ddns\" : {\n"
"      \"ddns-domains\" : [\n"
"        {\n"
"          \"name\" : \"your.domain.tld.\",\n"
"          \"key-name\": \"rndc-key\",\n"
"          \"dns-servers\" : [\n"
"            {\n"
"              \"ip-address\" : \"127.0.0.1\",\n"
"              \"port\" : 53\n"
"            }\n"
"          ]\n"
"        }\n"
"      ]\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"reverse-ddns\" : {\n"
"      \"ddns-domains\" : [\n"
"        {\n"
"          \"name\" : \"56.168.192.in-addr.arpa.\",\n"
"          \"key-name\": \"rndc-key\",\n"
"          \"dns-servers\" : [\n"
"            {\n"
"              \"ip-address\" : \"127.0.0.1\",\n"
"              \"port\" : 53\n"
"            }\n"
"          ]\n"
"        }\n"
"      ]\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    \"loggers\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"name\": \"kea-dhcp-ddns\",\n"
"        \"output_options\": [\n"
"          {\n"
"            \"output\": \"/var/log/kea/kea-ddns.log\",\n"
"            \"pattern\": \"%D{%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S.%q} %-5p %m\\n\"\n"
"          }\n"
"        ],\n"
"        \"severity\": \"INFO\",\n"
"        \"debuglevel\": 0\n"
"      }\n"
"    ]\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
"// End /etc/kea/kea-dhcp-ddns.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
