#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The value of <literal>secret</literal> is just an example.  Generate the key"
" for your installation by using the <command>rndc-confgen -a</command> "
"command or the <command>tsig-keygen</command> command which both are "
"provided by <xref linkend=\"bind\"/>."
