"tua instalação usando o comando <command>rndc-confgen -a</command> ou o "
"comando <command>tsig-keygen</command>, ambos fornecidos por <xref "
"linkend=\"bind\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/server/major/kea.xml:668
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In this example configuration, it is assumed that the DNS server runs on the"
" same machine as Kea does (accessible via <literal>127.0.0.1</literal>) and "
"that this machine has the IP <literal>192.168.56.2</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Nessa configuração de exemplo, é presumido que o servidor DNS executa na "
"mesma máquina que o Kea (acessível via <literal>127.0.0.1</literal>) e que "
"essa máquina tenha o IP <literal>192.168.56.2</literal>."

